From: ROCKNIX/DUCKTALE
Subject: [REVERT-BISECT cut 1] mailbox core refactor to v7.0 (IPCC doorbell to ADSP)

The 7.1 merge window refactored the generic mailbox core (active_req
NULL -> MBOX_NO_MSG sentinel, TXDONE_* renames) and DELETED the private
mailbox.h. All qcom AP<->ADSP signalling (smp2p, glink, rpmh) rings the
IPCC doorbell through this core. Revert mailbox.c to v7.0 and restore
the deleted mailbox.h. Safe: the only new-API consumer (tegra-hsp) is
not built for sm8750. TEST-ONLY revert-bisect of the VBUS-in-suspend
wedge.

